# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "the guide's panel: the door to the feedback form"
msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Compartir comentarios"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the button that brings the panel back after a screenshot"
msgid "Back to my feedback"
msgstr "Volver a mis comentarios"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: back to the guide's doors"
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Volver"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: a screenshot that does not decode"
msgid "That picture could not be opened. Try another one."
msgstr "No se pudo abrir esa imagen. Pruebe con otra."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the screenshot, read aloud, with its keys"
msgid "Your screenshot. Marks on it: {markCount}. The arrow keys move a ring, Enter marks the spot."
msgstr "Su captura de pantalla. Marcas en ella: {markCount}. Las flechas mueven un círculo y Enter marca el lugar."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the drawing tools, read aloud"
msgid "Draw on your screenshot"
msgstr "Dibuje sobre su captura de pantalla"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: drawing tool"
msgid "Arrow"
msgstr "Flecha"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: drawing tool"
msgid "Pen"
msgstr "Lápiz"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: drawing tool"
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Deshacer"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: drawing tool, removes every mark"
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Borrar todo"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: takes the screenshot off"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Quitar"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: when capturing the screen fails or is cancelled"
msgid "The screen was not shared. Choose a picture instead, or send it without one."
msgstr "No se compartió la pantalla. Elija una imagen, o envíelo sin ella."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: after sending, shared"
msgid "Your village's team has it. A copy of your words reaches the platform team so a fix can land for every village. Your name and your screenshot stay here."
msgstr "El equipo de su aldea ya lo tiene. Una copia de sus palabras llega al equipo de la plataforma para que el arreglo sirva a todas las aldeas. Su nombre y su captura de pantalla se quedan aquí."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: closes the panel after sending"
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Listo"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the kind, how something felt"
msgid "How it felt"
msgstr "Cómo se sintió"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the words, for a bug"
msgid "What happened, and what did you expect?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasó, y qué esperaba?"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the words, for an idea"
msgid "What would help, and who would it serve?"
msgstr "¿Qué ayudaría, y a quién serviría?"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the words, for how something felt"
msgid "What did you notice, and how did it feel?"
msgstr "¿Qué notó, y cómo se sintió?"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, a bug and its page"
msgid "Something broke on the {page} page."
msgstr "Algo falló en la página {page}."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, an idea and its page"
msgid "An idea, sent from the {page} page."
msgstr "Una idea, enviada desde la página {page}."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, feedback and its page"
msgid "How the {page} page felt to you."
msgstr "Cómo sintió usted la página {page}."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the heading, with the guide's name"
msgid "Tell {guide} what you found"
msgstr "Cuéntele a {guide} lo que encontró"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: under the heading"
msgid "In your words, to {village}'s team."
msgstr "Con sus propias palabras, al equipo de {village}."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the screenshot's heading"
msgid "A screenshot, if it helps"
msgstr "Una captura de pantalla, si ayuda"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: how to mark the screenshot"
msgid "Draw an arrow to the spot, or circle it with the pen."
msgstr "Dibuje una flecha hacia el lugar, o enciérrelo con el lápiz."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: capture the screen on a computer"
msgid "Capture this screen"
msgstr "Capturar esta pantalla"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: hide the panel so the member can take a phone screenshot"
msgid "Step aside to take one"
msgstr "Apartarse para tomarla"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: pick a screenshot from the device"
msgid "Choose a picture"
msgstr "Elegir una imagen"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: how a phone screenshot works"
msgid "Step aside, take a screenshot with your phone, tap the way back, then choose it from your photos."
msgstr "Apártese, tome una captura con su teléfono, toque el botón para volver y elíjala de sus fotos."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the read-back's heading, with the guide's name"
msgid "What {guide} heard"
msgstr "Lo que {guide} entendió"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, a marked screenshot"
msgid "With your screenshot, and {marks} marks on it."
msgstr "Con su captura de pantalla, y {marks} marcas en ella."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, a screenshot with one mark"
msgid "With your screenshot, and one mark on it."
msgstr "Con su captura de pantalla, y una marca en ella."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide heard, a screenshot"
msgid "With your screenshot."
msgstr "Con su captura de pantalla."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the title field"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: what the guide does with it"
msgid "Passed on in your words. The team decides what happens next."
msgstr "Se pasa con sus propias palabras. El equipo decide qué sigue."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: under the suggested title"
msgid "Suggested from your first line. Change it if you like."
msgstr "Sugerido a partir de su primera línea. Cámbielo si quiere."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: where it goes, shared, naming the hub"
msgid "Where this goes: {village}'s team, and a copy of the words to the platform team at {hub}, so a bug fixed once is fixed for every village. Your name and your screenshot stay here."
msgstr "Adónde va: al equipo de {village}, y una copia de las palabras al equipo de la plataforma en {hub}, para que una falla arreglada una vez quede arreglada en todas las aldeas. Su nombre y su captura de pantalla se quedan aquí."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the button"
msgid "Send to {village}'s team"
msgstr "Enviar al equipo de {village}"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "Admin, feedback: the screenshot"
msgid "The screenshot sent with this feedback"
msgstr "La captura de pantalla enviada con este comentario"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "Admin, feedback: the screenshot failed"
msgid "The screenshot did not load. Try again"
msgstr "La captura de pantalla no cargó. Intente de nuevo"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "Admin, feedback: open the screenshot"
msgid "Show the screenshot"
msgstr "Mostrar la captura de pantalla"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "Admin, p"
msgid "Nothing yet. Members send it from the guide's panel in the corner (Share feedback), or from the footer's Report a Bug link."
msgstr "Nada todavía. Los miembros lo envían desde el panel de la guía en la esquina (Compartir comentarios), o desde el enlace Reportar una falla del pie de página."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "the guide's panel: the kicker over the guide's name"
msgid "Your village guide"
msgstr "La guía de su aldea"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the home page's name in the read-back, as in 'the home page'"
msgid "home"
msgstr "de inicio"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "voice field purpose: feedback detail, three kinds"
msgid "For a bug: what you did, what you expected and what happened. For an idea: how it would work and who it serves. For how something felt: what you noticed, and how it felt."
msgstr "Para una falla: qué hizo, qué esperaba y qué pasó. Para una idea: cómo funcionaría y a quién sirve. Para cómo se sintió algo: qué notó y cómo se sintió."

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: where the copy goes, when the hub gives no name"
msgid "the platform's hub"
msgstr "el centro de la plataforma"

# needs-native-review: the guide's panel, Share feedback, 2026-11-26
msgctxt "guide feedback: the keyboard's way to mark the screenshot"
msgid "No mouse or finger handy? Tab to the picture, move the ring with the arrow keys and press Enter. Or say where it is in your words above; the picture goes as it is."
msgstr "¿Sin ratón ni dedo a mano? Llegue a la imagen con Tab, mueva el círculo con las flechas y presione Enter. O diga dónde está con sus palabras arriba; la imagen se envía tal como está."
